      {
        "name": "places/ChIJL-tGn6EBBDQRI0pQu9lSdqo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aaVQwdExUV3B5TTFCU1l6WkdPVEZyU2pOWlZFRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "可麗餅很好吃，香味濃郁，調味得當。拉格啤酒帶著一絲果香，很驚喜。\n週末夜晚比較忙，服務人員不太responsive——你需要等待一個他們稍微不太忙的空隙，然後想辦法引起他們的注意力。\nbtw，只有一個小時的用餐時間。\n\nThe crêpe was quite delicious — rich in aroma and nicely balanced in flavour. The lager had a hint of fruitiness, which was a pleasant surprise.\nIt was pretty busy on a weekend night, so the staff weren’t very responsive — you basically have to wait for a moment when they’re slightly less occupied, then find a way to catch their attention.\nbtw, you only have 1 hour dinner time.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "可麗餅很好吃，香味濃郁，調味得當。拉格啤酒帶著一絲果香，很驚喜。\n週末夜晚比較忙，服務人員不太responsive——你需要等待一個他們稍微不太忙的空隙，然後想辦法引起他們的注意力。\nbtw，只有一個小時的用餐時間。\n\nThe crêpe was quite delicious — rich in aroma and nicely balanced in flavour. The lager had a hint of fruitiness, which was a pleasant surprise.\nIt was pretty busy on a weekend night, so the staff weren’t very responsive — you basically have to wait for a moment when they’re slightly less occupied, then find a way to catch their attention.\nbtw, you only have 1 hour dinner time.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
